license: "CC-BY-4.0"
type: software
abstract: "A practical manual for designing and implementing mobile phone data initiatives for official statistics, public policy, development, and humanitarian applications. The handbook covers planning, partnerships, data access, processing pipelines, quality, governance, safeguards, and communication."
